{95}{Whatever needs to be done, of course. This place is my home. As I'm the eldest daughter, if there's a task that needs doing, I'll help do it. Making the beds, picking the bananas, doing Lasou's laundry.. I mean, the laundry. [She almost become flustered]}{Whatever needs to be done, of course. This place is my home. As I'm the eldest daughter, if there's a task that needs doing, I'll help do it. Making the beds, picking the bananas, doing Lasou's laundry.. I mean, the laundry. [She almost become flustered]}{}{}{}{gf 2819 1}
