{106}{I hope you will. You see, one of the men guarding the exit from the grove is Lasou Vlafa. He's just visiting here but immediately volunteered to help in anyway he could. Please, sir, I care a lot for him. We are in a desperate situation here and could use all the help we can get.}{I hope you will. You see, one of the men guarding the exit from the grove is Lasou Vlafa. He's just visiting here but immediately volunteered to help in anyway he could. Please, madam, I care a lot for him. We are in a desperate situation here and could use all the help we can get.}{}{}{}{}
{107}{Your first love, I assume? [You smile] I shall certainly consider lending my assistance.}{}{5}{}{112}{}
{108}{First time in love, eh? [You smile] Me understand. Me tink some more 'bout helpin"}{}{-4}{}{112}{}
{109}{I see. And... What sort of incentive would you be offering for my aid in this matter?}{}{5}{}{120}{}
