{155}{Oh, certainly! Ancient history and mythology happens to be a passion of mine. So, have you ever heard the legend of the Merow Vortahm?}{Oh, certainly! Ancient history and mythology happens to be a passion of mine. So, have you ever heard the legend of the Merow Vortahm?}{}{}{}{}
{156}{Yes, I have, actually I should say an abbreviated version of the tale. Perhaps you could expand my knowledge.}{}{5}{gf 2812 1}{160}{}
{157}{No, I haven't. Please, enlighten me.}{}{5}{gf 2812 0}{180}{}
{158}{Yuh! Me hear story in Brandy-buck. Tell me again. Mebee you know more tings about dis Merow ting.}{}{-4}{gf 2812 1}{160}{}
{159}{No... Me not know dis. Yuu tell me, den me know.}{}{-4}{gf 2812 0}{180}{}
{160}{[She basicly repeats what you've already heard but adds that Merow is over 3800 years old, can use Charm, Poison Vapors, and Harm spells, and cannot be trusted to keep her word.]}{[She basicly repeats what you've already heard but adds that Merow is over 3800 years old, can use Charm, Poison Vapors, and Harm spells, and cannot be trusted to keep her word.]}{}{}{}{}
{161}{That's more than I knew before. Although I doubt I will have much of a conversation with her, knowing of her treachery will be a help.}{}{5}{}{163}{}
{162}{Dat's more than me heard b'fore. Tanks. Me don' tink her an' I will say much, but me knows not to trust her.}{}{-4}{}{163}{}
{163}{Keep in mind, although Merow and her offspring live forever, they're still mortal. In fact, several stories tell of fire-spells being used to eradicate infestations. We already know these ones fear fire. Oh, before I forget, there's a good chance that the queen spider might be the original Merow Vortahm.}{Keep in mind, although Merow and her offspring live forever, they're still mortal. In fact, several stories tell of fire-spells being used to eradicate infestations. We already know these ones fear fire. Oh, before I forget, there's a good chance that the queen spider might be the original Merow Vortahm.}{}{}{}{}
{164}{How so?}{}{5}{}{166}{}
{165}{Why you tink dat?}{}{-4}{}{166}{}
{166}{There's been virtually no sighting of these creatures for over two hundred years. With Cattan largely cleared, there isn't too many places left for magical creatures to hide. That tells me that there must be only one or two breeding females left in the world. Merow would be one of them. Hopefully, the last.}{There's been virtually no sighting of these creatures for over two hundred years. With Cattan largely cleared, there isn't too many places left for magical creatures to hide. That tells me that there must be only one or two breeding females left in the world. Merow would be one of them. Hopefully, the last.}{}{}{}{}
{167}{[You nod] Yes. It would almost be worth the risk to speak with the queen and learn for certain.}{}{5}{}{169}{}
{168}{[You nod] Yuh. Me see whut yuu sayin' It be almos' worth da risk to talk to her an' find out if she is da furst Merow.}{}{-4}{}{169}{}
{169}{Don't take that chance @PCNAME@. Remember, she can't be trusted and she'll enchant you in an instant. Kill her first and we'll worry about the questions later.}{Don't take that chance @PCNAME@. Remember, she can't be trusted and she'll enchant you in an instant. Kill her first and we'll worry about the questions later.}{}{}{}{}
{170}{Good advice. Thanks for all your help.}{}{5}{}{172}{}
{171}{Gud to know stuff. Tanks fur tellin' me.}{}{-4}{}{172}{}
{172}{One last thing, a few days ago our local gypsy woman set up camp in the field on Wild Boar Road. If you need healing or poison potions, she has a small supply she'll sell you. As you head west from here, go past the bonfires to the fork in the road and stay to the left. You can't miss her.}{One last thing, a few days ago our local gypsy woman set up camp in the field on Wild Boar Road. If you need healing or poison potions, she has a small supply she'll sell you. As you head west from here, go past the bonfires to the fork in the road and stay to the left. You can't miss her.}{}{}{}{}
{173}{I appreciate you telling me that. May I ask another question?}{}{5}{}{60}{}
{174}{Tanks fur tellin' me dat. Me aks anuuter ques-shun?}{}{-4}{}{60}{}
{175}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{180}{Well, you see, there's this story from over 3800 years ago when this human woman who wanted to live forever made a deal with a demon. She got her wish but she became a demon herself. He turned her into a spider - because she was a weaver-woman, you see - but she has the power to make people see her as a beautiful woman.}{Well, you see, there's this story from over 3800 years ago when this human woman who wanted to live forever made a deal with a demon. She got her wish but she became a demon herself. He turned her into a spider - because she was a weaver-woman, you see - but she has the power to make people see her as a beautiful woman.}{}{}{}{}
{181}{[You listen]}{}{1}{}{182}{}
{182}{When she finds a place out in the middle of nowhere; a farm or hamlet; she'll come to the door in the early evening and make the people think she's just a human woman who's out seeing the sights, and got lost. They'll offer her some refreshment or maybe even a place to sleep for the night, but she's actually sizin' them up as a source of food for her young.}{When she finds a place out in the middle of nowhere; a farm or hamlet; she'll come to the door in the early evening and make the people think she's just a human woman who's out seeing the sights, and got lost. They'll offer her some refreshment or maybe even a place to sleep for the night, but she's actually sizin' them up as a source of food for her young.}{}{}{}{}
{183}{[You listen]}{}{1}{}{186}{}
{184}{Look miss. This is facinating, but all I really need to know is what are their weaknesses and what's the easiest way to kill them.}{}{5}{}{193}{}
{185}{Wait. Dis is fas-in atin' but whut me need to know is whut's dere weak-ness an' whut's an easy way to kill em.}{}{-4}{}{193}{}
{186}{After she leaves, she finds a quiet, dark place close by and lays her eggs. A few days later, the eggs hatch, and the village is quickly over-run by the baby spiders. You see, they too have their momma's power to cloud your mind, and make you think you like them. Over the centuries it's become just a story about why you should be careful who you open your door to.}{After she leaves, she finds a quiet, dark place close by and lays her eggs. A few days later, the eggs hatch, and the village is quickly over-run by the baby spiders. You see, they too have their momma's power to cloud your mind, and make you think you like them. Over the centuries it's become just a story about why you should be careful who you open your door to.}{}{}{}{ru 2229, gf 2812 1}
{187}{I see. These creatures certainly are not to be underestimated. Is there anything more?}{}{5}{}{191}{}
{188}{Me see. Tanks fur tellin me. Is dere anythin' more?}{}{-4}{}{191}{}
{189}{Look miss. This is facinating, but all I really need to know is what are their weaknesses and what's the easiest way to kill them.}{}{5}{}{193}{}
{190}{Wait. Dis is fas-in atin' but whut me need to know is whut's dere weak-ness an' whut's an easy way to kill em.}{}{-4}{}{193}{}
{191}{Only that Charm isn't the only spell she knows.  According to the legend she can also use Harm and Poison Vapors. Oh, and those who tried to bargain or reason with a Vortahm soon discovered that none of them will keep their promise. }{Only that Charm isn't the only spell she knows.  According to the legend she can also use Harm and Poison Vapors. Oh, and those who tried to bargain or reason with a Vortahm soon discovered that none of them will keep their promise. }{}{}{}{}
{192}{A:}{}{1}{}{163}{}
{193}{I see. The only weaknesses they are known to have, and we discovered the second one, is a fear of fire and they can't cross deep water. Lasou said he saw holes on their sides and thinks that's how they breathe. Since they're trapped on an island, fire may also be the best way to kill them.}{I see. The only weaknesses they are known to have, and we discovered the second one, is a fear of fire and they can't cross deep water. Lasou said he saw holes on their sides and thinks that's how they breathe. Since they're trapped on an island, fire may also be the best way to kill them.}{}{}{}{}
